---
layout: base.njk
permalink: "knowledge.html"
title: "Knowledge | NexBridge Solutions"
description: "Practical engineering articles organized around NexBridge's design, prototyping and factory digitalization solutions."
---

<section class="page-header">
<div class="hero-glow"></div>
<div class="container">
<span class="hero-eyebrow">Knowledge</span>
<h1>Practical Knowledge For Engineering Decisions</h1>
<p>Articles and field notes organized around the same three solution areas we deliver.</p>
</div>
</section>

<section id="blog" class="knowledge-library section fade-up">
<div class="container">

<div class="knowledge-simple-intro">
<div>
<span>KNOWLEDGE LIBRARY</span>
<h2>Browse By Solution Topic</h2>
</div>
<p>Short, practical analysis for engineers and operational teams. Select a topic or search the complete library.</p>
</div>

<div class="knowledge-toolbar knowledge-toolbar--simple">
<div class="knowledge-search">
<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="7"/><line x1="21" y1="21" x2="16.65" y2="16.65"/></svg>
<input type="text" id="knowledgeSearchInput" placeholder="Search by title, keyword or topic..." aria-label="Search Knowledge articles">
</div>
<div class="topic-chips" id="topicChips">
<button type="button" class="topic-chip active" data-topic="all">All Topics</button>
{% for group in collections.knowledgeBySolution %}
<button type="button" class="topic-chip" data-topic="{{ group.title }}">{{ group.title }}</button>
{% endfor %}
</div>
</div>

<p class="knowledge-empty" id="knowledgeEmptyState" hidden>No articles match your search.</p>

<div class="knowledge-groups knowledge-list-groups" id="blogGrid">
{% for group in collections.knowledgeBySolution %}
<section class="topic-group knowledge-list-group" data-topic-group="{{ group.title }}" id="{{ group.slug }}">
<div class="topic-group-header knowledge-list-header">
<div>
<span>0{{ loop.index }}</span>
<h2>{{ group.title }}</h2>
<p>{{ group.description }}</p>
</div>
<span class="topic-group-count">{{ group.articles.length }} article{% if group.articles.length != 1 %}s{% endif %}</span>
</div>

<div class="knowledge-article-list">
{% for article in group.articles %}
<a class="card knowledge-list-item"
   data-search="{{ article.data.title | lower }} {{ article.data.excerpt | lower }} {{ article.data.topic | lower }} {{ article.data.tags | join(' ') | lower }}"
   href="{{ article.url }}">
<div class="knowledge-list-main">
<span>{{ article.data.topic }}</span>
<h3>{{ article.data.title }}</h3>
<p>{{ article.data.excerpt }}</p>
</div>
<div class="knowledge-list-meta">
<time>{{ article.data.date | readableDate }}</time>
<b>Read article &rarr;</b>
</div>
</a>
{% endfor %}
</div>
</section>
{% endfor %}
</div>

</div>
</section>
